false. Explicitly typecast the constant or the expression to the correct range to avoid this warning
if you think the code is correct.', 'Possível falha de lógica, incompatibilidade de tipos, obsolescência ou efeitos colaterais em tempo de execução.', 'Corrija a inconsistência apontada para evitar comportamentos inesperados no executável final.', 'N', '') MATCHING (CODE);
UPDATE OR INSERT INTO FPC_MESSAGES (CODE, SEVERITY, MESSAGE_PATTERN, DESCRIPTION_PTBR, PROBABLE_CAUSE, MANUAL_SOLUTION, CAN_AUTO_FIX, AUTO_FIX_STRATEGY) VALUES (4045, 'WARNING', 'Comparison might be always true due to range of constant and expression', 'There is a comparison between a constant and an expression where the constant is out of the
valid range of values of the expression. Because of type promotion, the statement will always evaluate to
true. Explicitly typecast the constant or the expression to the correct range to avoid this warning
